            "en": "Al-Baghawi keeps the image with a different stress. The root of takwir, he says, is wrapping and gathering, al-laff wal-jam', and he too names the turban. Ma'arif al-Qur'an defines takwir as throwing one thing on top of another and so hiding it, and explains the choice of word: the Quran describes the alternation as ordinary perception sees it. When night comes it is as if a curtain had been thrown over the light of day, and when day comes the darkness of night goes behind the curtain.",
